In the last two weeks in Ukraine, there has been a sharp increase in demand for power banks, candles, and stoves. Ukrainians are preparing for a tough winter, according to Rozetka.

It is reported that:
▪️power banks on the website are being purchased almost 4 times more frequently;
▪️candles and gas stoves – 3 times more;
▪️generators and flashlights – 2.5 times more;
▪️charging devices and gas cylinders – 2 times more;
▪️solar panels – 1.6 times more;
▪️stoves – 1.5 times more.

